{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263886-calculating-soak","id":1263886,"title":"Calculating Soak","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-31T14:27:45-07:00","id":1263886,"title":"Calculating Soak","content":"Hi! I've got a Lunar exalt (Str 5, Dex 5, Sta 5) with Deadly Beastman (Str/Dex/Sta 6) and the Armored Hide and Huge mutations (Str 8, Dex 6, Sta 8 and +4B/4L soak).<br /> For simplicity's sake, let's just start with the Str 8, Dex 6, Sta 8 and get to it.<br /> <br /> 1. How do I calculate my soak dice?<br /> 2. I've got 3rd Excellency for all physical stats and Relentless Lunar Fury (Essence 4). Am I correct this would add 8 (Stamina) + 4 (Essence) to these totals? Any restrictions?<br /> 3. I've got a variety of soak/hardness charms selected. Are there limits to how many dice can be added?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","name":"g3taso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3814_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T14:49:09-07:00","id":1263895,"title":"","content":"You might want to specify which edition you're playing if you want any coherent answers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T14:55:19-07:00","id":1263899,"title":"","content":"You are right. I'm playing 2nd edition. But I'm game if people want to provide answers to others as well (and tell us which they are referring to)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","name":"g3taso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3814_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T15:14:33-07:00","id":1263900,"title":"","content":"For 2nd edition:<br /> <br /> Your bashing soak is equal to Stamina, and lethal soak is half that.<br /> <br /> So with your armoured hide, that's 12B/8L. (It's not soak dice per-se, it's a soak rating.)<br /> <br /> There's no limit to how much you can add to your soak.<br /> <br /> As to the 3rd excellency, I think that's how it works, though I'm not 100%.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> For 3rd edition, it'd be simpler. Your soak from Stamina is just 5 (doesn't matter if it's lethal or bashing). The Huge merit adds a health level, not soak.<br /> The Armoured Hide mutation adds a number equal to how many points you spent on it (0-5).<br /> <br /> DBT adds, I think, your Strength to your Soak (in this case 5).<br /> So, with DBT and maxed out Armoured Hide, your soak is 15.<br /> <br /> But that's just &quot;I think&quot; because the Lunar book's not out yet, just a few teaser charms and an example NPC.<br /> <br /> There's no 3rd excellency, just a Stamina Excellency, which can increase soak somehow, but we don't know how that works yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 10-31-2018, 06:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-03T03:48:40-07:00","id":1264404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>g3taso</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263886-calculating-soak#post1263886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi! I've got a Lunar exalt (Str 5, Dex 5, Sta 5) with Deadly Beastman (Str/Dex/Sta 6) and the Armored Hide and Huge mutations (Str 8, Dex 6, Sta 8 and +4B/4L soak).<br /> For simplicity's sake, let's just start with the Str 8, Dex 6, Sta 8 and get to it.<br /> <br /> 1. How do I calculate my soak dice?</div> </div> </div> </div>your soak rating is equal to your stamina for bashing, \u00bd stamina for lethal and zero for aggravated before adding bonuses.<br /> In your case that comes to 12B/8L/0A, in Deadly Beastman form, but before charms.<br /> Note that this is rating not dice, you subtract it from the damage dice pool rather than roll them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>g3taso</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263886-calculating-soak#post1263886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. I've got 3rd Excellency for all physical stats and Relentless Lunar Fury (Essence 4). Am I correct this would add 8 (Stamina) + 4 (Essence) to these totals? Any restrictions?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, you are not correct. &quot;derived rating&quot; in 2nd edition is a system term for things which are theoretically under the hood dice pools, but which just use the average of 1 success pr. 2 dice for the sake of speed of play. This is also why the reroll charm can enhance them.<br /> Soak however are not representing a roll like this, so the 3rd excellency does nothing.<br /> the first and 2nd still works through, so you might want to consider taking one of those instead.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>g3taso</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263886-calculating-soak#post1263886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. I've got a variety of soak/hardness charms selected. Are there limits to how many dice can be added?</div> </div> </div> </div>no, there are not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/613-vegetalss4","name":"Vegetalss4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar613_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T23:44:08-08:00","id":1502482,"title":"","content":"If you want replies that make sense, you should probably say which edition you're using.<br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><a href=\"https://stumblegames.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">stumble guys</span></a></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27673-manisla","name":"Manisla","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}